.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-task 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-task \- What long\-running tasks are doing, read without opening a log
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten task\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
What long\-running tasks are doing, read without opening a log
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-task\-alive(1)
What tasks are running right now and what phase each is in — one call, no log reading
.TP
batten\-task\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
